```twee
:: StoryTitle
Endless Reading

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "A1B2C3D4-E5F6-7890-ENDLESSREADING",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Endless Reading"
}

:: StoryInit
<<set $readingBalance = 0>>

<<widget "shiftword">>
	<<if $readingBalance >= 5>>
		<<print $args[1]>>
	<<elseif $readingBalance <= -5>>
		<<print $args[2]>>
	<<else>>
		<<print $args[0]>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Endless Reading

The <<shiftword "book" "play" "script">> lay upon a table beneath a
<<shiftword "yellow" "golden" "pale">> lamp.

An old <<shiftword "king" "figure" "shadow">> watched from the far end
of the room.

Its <<shiftword "mask" "face" "veil">> seemed familiar, though no one
could remember why.

The pages rustled.

The <<shiftword "book" "play" "script">> opened itself.

The <<shiftword "yellow" "golden" "pale">> light deepened.

The <<shiftword "king" "figure" "shadow">> moved one step closer.

Its <<shiftword "mask" "face" "veil">> tilted slightly.

''Reading Balance:'' <<= $readingBalance>>

<<link "Read On">>
	<<set $readingBalance += 1>>
	<<goto "Endless Reading">>
<</link>>

<<link "Rest">>
	<<set $readingBalance -= 1>>
	<<goto "Endless Reading">>
<</link>>
